# built helper binaries
# priv/boards/*/helpers holds C sources plus a Makefile; everything else in
# there is a build artifact. Allowlisted rather than naming each target,
# because naming them failed once: the rule listed `unlock`, the Makefile grew
# a second target, and a 67 KB aarch64 ELF got committed (a30658b).
priv/boards/*/helpers/*
!priv/boards/*/helpers/*.c
!priv/boards/*/helpers/*.h
!priv/boards/*/helpers/Makefile
!priv/boards/*/helpers/*.md
!priv/boards/*/helpers/tests/
priv/boards/*/helpers/tests/*
!priv/boards/*/helpers/tests/*.c
!priv/boards/*/helpers/tests/*.h
